# Public changelog (/updates)

**Policy:** [`docs/CHANGELOG_PUBLIC.md`](../../docs/CHANGELOG_PUBLIC.md)

## When to update (required)

Update `src/site/changelog.ts` when shipping user-visible Board, Export/capture, Match/Scenes, Plan, or Materials/Guide **product** changes.

**Skip:** marketing (PH badge), copy-only, docs/backlog, hit-test tweaks, routing fixes.

## How

1. Add entry at **top** of `entries` (English, past tense). One entry = one user-visible change; batch by ship, not per commit.
2. Set `updatedAt` to ship date.
3. Run `npm run site:pages`.
4. Commit `changelog.ts` and `public/updates/` together.
